ALL COLLECTION USES IN REAL LIFE 

ArrayList       → Shopping Cart → Laptop, Mouse, Keyboard-------Data वारंवार read/access करायचा 
                                                                असेल

LinkedList      → Playlist      → Song1, Song2, Song3---------Elements add/remove जास्त असतील

***************************************

HashSet         → Unique Emails → jay@gmail.com, amit@gmail.com------Duplicate नको असेल

LinkedHashSet   → Search History → Pune, Mumbai, Delhi--------------Duplicate नको + insertion
                                                                    order हवा

TreeSet         → Prices        → 100, 200, 500, 1000---------------Unique + sorted data हवा

**************************************

HashMap         → Employee Data → 101 → Jay --------------------ID वरून data पटकन शोधायचा असेल

LinkedHashMap   → Recent Products → 101 → Laptop--------------Key-Value + insertion order हवा

TreeMap         → Student Marks → 101 → 80--------------------Key-Value + sorted keys हव्या

******************************************

Queue           → Bank Queue    → C1 → C2 → C3---------------First In → First Out (FIFO)

PriorityQueue   → Hospital      → Critical → Normal----------Priority नुसार processing

Deque           → Tasks         → Front ↔ Rear---------------दोन्ही ends वर add/remove

ArrayDeque      → Stack/Queue   → Page1, Page2, Page3-------Fast Stack/Queue operations

ConcurrentHashMap → Online Cache → UserId → UserData---------Multiple threads एकाच Map वर काम करत असतील
Hashtable          → Legacy App  → Username → Data----------Mainly legacy applications मध्ये


